honestav really took the term “crowd surfing” literally Honestav’s numbers started with one record. The 2024 song that put him on Billboard is sitting around 89 million Spotify streams. That’s the one that turned him from clips into a touring artist. After that: “Stuck On The Floor” is over 27 million. “Crash First” with MGK is over 16 million and hit No. 1 on iTunes Alternative. “Growin’ Pains” is over 12 million.

